पापक, अस्, इका or अकी, अम्, bad, evil, wicked;
(अम्), n. evil, wrong, wickedness, sin; (अस्), m. a
wicked person, rascal; an evil or malignant planet.

पापिष्ठ, अस्, आ, अम्, worst, lowest, most wicked;
exceedingly bad, very wicked.
—पापिष्ठ-तम,
अस्, आ, अम्, worst, most wicked; worse, more wicked.
—पापिष्ठ-तर, अस्, आ, अम्, worse, more wicked;
the very worst; exceedingly wicked.
